Refresh Feature
Create configuration profile: Congiguration profiles - Create - New Policy 
Select Windows10 or later and Settings catalog 
Add name and description click on next 
In the settings picker type "Config Refresh" and press enter from the settigns select Config refresh and Refresh Cadence 
Enable config refresh and for cadence type the value in minutes for example 30 then click on next 
Add scope tags, in assigment select the group that you want to apply the configuration profile then click on create 

To validate the settings once intune show deployed success you can go to 
HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Enrollments\” Intune Policy Provider GUID” \ConfigRefresh and it should have the values that you set in the congfiguration profile
